WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.292
[Waystead’s ABAXI fanfare] ABAXI presents.

00:00:03.292 --> 00:00:04.083
A small house sits by the sea.

00:00:04.083 --> 00:00:04.917
Inside, the room is sparsely furnished.

00:00:04.917 --> 00:00:05.792
Mira’s house starts out simple.

00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:08.292
Clack mines copper.

00:00:08.292 --> 00:00:11.375
Clack leaps and strikes with a sword.

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:13.375
Clack fires an arrow through the mine.

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:14.875
Clack fights in the neighborhood ring.

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:16.667
Clack enters the Staff Shop with a Kelp Lantern.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:17.875
Clack leaves with a Sunclaw Scepter.

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:18.708
A palace stands by the sea.

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:19.542
Inside the palace are canopy beds.

00:00:19.542 --> 00:00:21.333
Mira’s upgraded house has a glowing orrery.

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:23.333
Clack casts Tidehex in midair.

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:28.000
[Music swells] Clack wins the Imperial Dome championship. The crowd throws gold.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Clack. Code with the crabs. Powered by Decapod Labs.
